    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "But now, as I hold this photo in my hands, I see their smiles, their lives
    full and bright. My children, my grandchildren\u2014they have all grown, all
    flourished. A warmth spreads through me. I can finally rest."
